    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3731" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arrectārĭus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adr-</span></b> ), a, um,
			adj.
		arrectus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>in an erect position</i>, <i>erect</i>, <i>perpendicular;</i> hence, arrectaria,
				<i>the upright posts of a wall</i> (opp.
			transversarii, cross-beams), only <i><span class="en">Vitr. 2,
			8</span></i>, and 7, 3.</div>
